summary = "A monk has returned from his travels with a new type of turnip that is hardier and grows faster than local varieties."
description = "A monk known for his skill in gardening presents you with a sack of unfamiliar seeds. \"These are turnips from the northern lands, my Liege,\" he explains. \"They are ugly and bitter, but they grow fast in poor soil and can survive a mild frost. They could be a shield against a poor wheat harvest.\""
